    {
      "id": 349207,
      "username": "Bhargav_N",
      "name": "Bhargav N",
      "created_at": "2022-12-19T08:07:47.815Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Delivery Note is for selling. We need to send item for subcontract to suppliers(vendors),in return they process and give subcontract receipt with invoice.<br>\nIf we do that in delivery note it will be in the status of \" item delivered but not billed\" .<br>\nCurrently we are running version 14</p>",
